<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Owens-Illinois said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Owens-Illinois said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs upgraded Owens-Illinois Inc to trading buy from market outperform, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Further details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 15-1/2 on Friday.</p>
</text>
